  "description": "Stair 1.1 m wide, origin at its top edge on the deck level; descends along +X: treads at -0.29, -0.58 and -0.86 m, seabed foot at -1.15 m (0.5 m water below a deck 0.65 m above rest). Materials: WeatheredTimber, WetTimber (below the splash line), RustyIron. 1,180 triangles.",
  "brief": "Crescent Cove (Holodeck tropical-island) three-step jetty stair per the kit sheet: two-plank treads housed between stringers, bolted, with two round posts (a short one at the top left, a taller one on the right). Steps down from the platform's seaward edge into knee-deep water; risers 0.2875 m (bible: steps 0.35 m or less).",
